      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "8. A: Wǒ yào dào Tiān'ānmén qù kànkan. Zuò jǐlù gōnggòng qìchē hǎo?\n   I want to go see the Gate of Heavenly Peace. What bus should I take?\n   B: Xīngqītiān qìchē kě jǐ le. Nǐ zuì hǎo zǒuzhe qù.\n   It's Sunday and buses are really crowded. It would be best to walk.\n\nNotes on No. 8\n\nNotice that kě, \"indeed, certainly, really,\" is often accompanied by le at the end of the sentence:\n\nWǒ xiànzài zài kàn tā zuì xīnde shū, kě yǒu yìsi le.\nI'm reading his latest book now. It's really interesting.\n"
    }
